://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75312297_643955654606405_480568527955268312_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4jmLaPmaXL0Q7kNvwEv5bUV&_nc_oc=AdoarXzOyBYq2ss-nfBJpl8awYv4aUi5s2gYufV310rNPHtL2zvyMDuAYPvmYI-ZRl8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGmz0h6KwJ-Fv0P5SpVUsxeBgDOm8TbA4VmR6UzEEQumg&oe=6A774666"}, {"file_name": "Master.00_00_34_53.Still005.png", "id": "868776144968854", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57574721_868776148302187_2395318248093284663_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sXIo7rccmDQQ7kNvwGjsIQR&_nc_oc=AdpcAnFxao4z0NOTMAD2Z7XolC-xHjKboXMhIfCe9_6Kg5r2V-BOjESWn03MCb0Hqz8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHK9tPCOkLVeOn6W6_bepOJzAoaH0Rol-enMI_hz-zmZQ&oe=6A773BB2"}, {"file_name": "Master.00_00_25_53.Still002.png", "id": "692760662818107", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982461_692760666151440_1673600769700015261_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=T10B7D4O4F8Q7kNvwFz3m3b&_nc_oc=AdpITP7AQL3AjTFDKEsTrTVCpCtcoB1KkDnECO6vT_k9YMf0L6pMZxWEGBW1u3L5Fb8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGkP9CcCJogF3PgbFMeBOiqUd0nM4zikzm7nBITZ1V8yQ&oe=6A77357B"}, {"file_name": "2023-07-01 19-38-56.mp4.00_05_33_04.Still001.png", "id": "1014728119759484", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974571_1014728126426150_3738956639406327634_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pbchWdK09XwQ7kNvwHuZHyL&_nc_oc=Adpgxvwp6jaBuQtuPZ1JineCYR3WdXs93YjD1nlE9pshJgv_nQWOijKIl1EFSBeUwB0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGnYognuQpcuHbkfPdV7A4ISXkl35SwDzlgSx3A_ycE7g&oe=6A7712B3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer_End_Card-Recovered.png", "id": "273391962004750", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974788_273391965338083_1886064065722113930_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pzy8y1Il4sQQ7kNvwGFLlX4&_nc_oc=AdomHQKWWjFtv_qdNXhHYo-MRft4DrOnXABB8HThRIHXQQ29CHPi4hlaWpO6dY3Y4Kg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFBnBGzO2MphSC_c1wSjztP32qjMho-vOztGOKgZp63TA&oe=6A7710B2"}, "display_name": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures", "keywords": ["Cockpit", "Alien", "Green", "Space", "Physics"], "long_description": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures is a VR cockpit game combining ship management with action-arcade combat. You play as a (sometimes effective) bounty hunter with possibly questionable morals, currently in possession of a powerful little alien that you may or may not have stolen/liberated from the evil Empire. As the Empire closes in, you'll need to find a way to balance your ship's management with the onslaught of attacks. Do you have what it takes to survive?\n\n\u2022 Become one with the ship: Immerse yourself in a cockpit packed full from ceiling to floor with distinct physics-based interactions (Though make sure to keep your eye on them all if you want to survive!).\n\n\u2022 Rebel against The Empire: Engage in thrilling dogfights as squads of enemies pursue you to re-capture the small green treasure aboard your ship - shoot bullets, launch bombs, and raise your shields. It's going to get bumpy!\n\n\u2022 Navigate the vacuum of space: Control the ship with a radical and easy-to-use virtual flight stick design, dodge your way through hazardous space environments, and don't forget to do a barrel roll!\n\n\u2022 The little guy: Who could forget your cosmic friend, Ziggy?! This mysterious creature is a perfect fuel source. You can also play with them, use them as a resource, feed them, and most importantly pet them!\n\n\u2022 The Journey: Fight your way through 13 unique levels total. Forge a different path each time by beating challenges and unlocking harder worlds en route.", "short_description": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures is a VR cockpit game combining ship management with action-arcade combat. You play as a (sometimes effective) bounty hunter with possibly questionable morals, currently in possession of a powerful little alien that you may or may not have stolen/liberated from the evil Empire. As the Empire closes in, you'll need to find a way to balance your ship's management with the onslaught of attacks. Do you have what it takes to survive?"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Ziggy_Monoscopic.png", "id": "1296582511245835", "image_type": "APP_IMG_CUBEMAP_SOURCE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974446_1296582517912501_8438674573824683709_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=l8KcZegqe0gQ7kNvwG9bcp0&_nc_oc=AdpWoghuudQ9XF_qdHuFFlAxNTHHZ2L2o0WBfch2aoxKfOBe_gkvCCTJLGGH-ygT2t8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGLj1EOIFtnASLyoQ5WXnsE5jZSTqB4XuJ6x1CKAyd50Q&oe=6A774053"}, {"file_name": "CoverSquare.png", "id": "1124369782419830", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036658_1124369785753163_6062844584904789074_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0gvrwM8kR7EQ7kNvwHhV690&_nc_oc=Adq9wiSrIUoLWXDMivUnWhygEtVCIbQSBJprr4h1ZK5UMALVU3Q4BhaTH60LPkQH-Pc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHTrFp2kWDbdt1mCOybNChNKK0JthTGc9ziuZCawx-xag&oe=6A773C6F"}, {"file_name": "Icon_v1.png", "id": "1106448921139578", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001696_1106448927806244_1890053882317213161_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gIIEtNKMxBEQ7kNvwHd3r_H&_nc_oc=Adqeem5owwe_lhmyu3Xd8wx7JHgMyo7Wr-b1oAPNVAkxHKQTezrdpVqSDXlGJsLH4Rg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFSYiWLc9QAKtVwZpxPNZI5raQu9Ouso6jvYauI1VScMw&oe=6A770FE2"}, {"file_name": "Logo.png", "id": "973425620588096", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/86610716_973425627254762_521808747164